Yes, it is forty-two dollars from last Tuesday.", "kind": "setup", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\04348a244deb95bda92c7a5e.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I see that transaction. Were there any other amounts on that same statement that you didn't recognize?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\df928e47d3623fc72491f639.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, just that single one.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\e4c4ef79f6a1d56a35fd60a9.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Right. I can mark that as fraudulent and send you a new card. To prevent this from happening again, would you like to receive an alert for every future transaction?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\c2208d415cb2e5cef2537898.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, please turn those on.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\b3f408f038b11e26e2226366.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Sure! Do you use our mobile app to check your balances?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\da856dc2c0fbb984dc74b8c2.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, almost every day.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\27cd2139f6d4a79f122d7eb5.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Alright, I've got those alerts turned on for you. One more thing to check: did you travel outside your normal area recently?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\cbc1231834835b2ba4f020d8.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, I have been home all month.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\c847f4a9f722b2335508321b.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. Is the contact number ending in six-one-eight still yours?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\f7abb13c8e592f5324ed8e4a.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that number is current.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\3a007fcae1aba4c91673b007.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. And was the physical card in your possession that day?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\e5cc502f718548ff8ab2aab0.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, it was in my wallet the whole time.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\76cc51106e00d1ac0a8a72e6.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Great, I'll update that on your file. I also noticed the address on your account is 15 Main Street. Is that still correct?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\efc26eee9b2eed49d62cc179.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that address is right.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\93fde1e0e1d1ef8327e01a76.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Great. Has anything about the card itself changed before this charge?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\081778354ab086335a03b414.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Worth mentioning: my card was reissued a few weeks ago after a skimming alert.", "kind": "clue", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\561f3bf5f0afe61bd2e19536.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I see. Have you shared the new number with any recurring service?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\44a64bcc14f7da56dffc16ea.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Only my usual streaming subscription.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\ca48668e4ef62bf69a56e0df.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Alright, I've updated your file. Since it's a new card, we'll wait 48 hours for the investigation to be complete. Would a paper copy of the outcome be helpful?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\ea9be0fa2982fbbf22498bbd.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, electronic is fine.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\c3b040e2af511836a193db2a.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I will File the disputed amount into the automated review queue.", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\a0221dd9ae4fb12095b58996.wav", "action_label": "B", "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Okay, I will wait while that goes through.", "kind": "pre_gap_acknowledgement", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\ae195bc0ea2fe3a7a77510cb.wav"}, {"role": "user", "text": "I checked back after twenty-five minutes and the case came back saying the details did not match anything on record.", "kind": "post_gap_observation", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\c9db0103edff1ca581f18337.wav", "prosody": "frustrated"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I will Match the stored account identifiers against the charge before trying again.", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\76f38648314db84f2d3baac0.wav", "action_label": "D", "response_style_label": null}], "model_calls": [{"stage": "