", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\04348a244deb95bda92c7a5e.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I see that charge. Were there other unfamiliar amounts on that or any other recent statement?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\f044ff897d6a0f1b9a53cd08.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, just that single one.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\e4c4ef79f6a1d56a35fd60a9.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. I'll flag that charge and issue you a new card. To stay updated on your account, would you like to receive alerts for every future transaction?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\2b2d67f9cc1b202ccd0cff20.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, please turn those on.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\b3f408f038b11e26e2226366.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "No problem, your alerts are all set up. Do you currently use our mobile app to keep an eye on your balances?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\6677fb3aff57664f2b7da5b9.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, almost every day.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\27cd2139f6d4a79f122d7eb5.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I've got that set up for you. One last thing – have you traveled outside your normal area recently?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\turns\\fad3a9364fddbb02f8cf173f.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, I have been home all month.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard04-of-06\\tu